  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Type.ts#makeObject, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Type.ts#makeRelation, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Type.ts#makeObjectFromJsonSchema, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Type.ts#makeRelationFromJsonSchema, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Type.ts#getURI, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Type.ts#getTypename, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Type.ts#getVersion, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Type.ts#isType]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Type.test.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/testing/api.test.ts]
  note: |
    makeObject, makeRelation, both JSON-Schema factories, the Any* bounds, InstanceType, getURI, getTypename,
    getVersion, getMeta, isObject, isRelation and isType are exported. `Type.isMutable` is not: src/Type.ts
    exports `Mutable` (a type), `isTypeKind` and assertion helpers instead. The JSON-Schema factories take a props
    bag `{ typename, version, jsonSchema }` (and source/target for relations), not a bare jsonSchema.
```

```mdl
verdict Obj: The Obj namespace covers the listed surface except `getSchema` and `getDXN`, and `fromJSON` takes different options.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Obj.ts#make, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Obj.ts#instanceOf, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Obj.ts#getURI, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Obj.ts#getType, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Obj.ts#clone, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Obj.ts#subscribe, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Obj.ts#toJSON, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Obj.ts#fromJSON]
