  note: |
    There is no `Obj.getSchema` (the code has `Obj.getType`, which returns the type entity) and no `Obj.getDXN`
    (the code has `Obj.getURI`, which returns a URI/EID, not a `dxn:echo:` DXN). `Obj.fromJSON` takes
    `{ refResolver, uri, database, parent }`, not `{ graph, db }`. The rest (make, Unknown/Any, MakeProps, isObject,
    instanceOf, isDeleted, getTypename/getTypeURI, getMeta, getSnapshot/snapshotOf, clone, getValue/setValue/update,
    subscribe, toJSON, Meta, ID) is exported.
```

