```mdl
verdict F-3.2: Obj.subscribe fires on mutation and query subscriptions re-evaluate.
  status: done
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Obj.ts#subscribe, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Obj.ts#update]
  tests: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo/src/Text.test.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-client/src/echo-handler/subscription.test.ts, github:dxos/dxos/packages/core/echo/echo-client-e2e/src/query.test.ts]
  note: |
    Mutation must happen inside `Obj.update`; direct assignment outside it throws. A query re-evaluates on every mutation but notifies only when its result set changes (see the e2e test 'does not fire on object updates').
```

